  dialogue:
  - Hey kiddo! Lotta bodies in the lake again. Gett'n to be that time o' year I guess.
  - Say, that reminds me of when they found your gam gam in there.
  - Anywho... them bodies ain't gon' fish themselves out. Better get a move on.
